## Hints

- E2: power at α/100 = P(reject | t=2.2, threshold = norm.ppf(1-α/200))
  — a two-sided test at level 0.0005 has a threshold near 3.6.
- E3: observed p-values are Uniform(0, p_true) — draw them that way,
  not as constants. Junk fraction = V/R over the run, averaged.
